window.products.push({"id":1107087,"name":"Cube Storage Bins, Collapsible Fabric Storage Cubes Bins, 11 Inch Cube Storage Bins with Handles, Foldable Storage Cubes (White/ Green, 6Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815F7IzYWUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"linen Durable Cube Storage Organizer Solution: Experience the right organization with our 6-pack cube storage organizer bins, designed to provide an exceptional storage solution for any space. These fabric storage cubes, available in white-gray bins and white-green bins, are perfect for use with your 6 cube storage organizer, effortlessly blending style and functionality. Our cube storage bins 11 x 11 inch offer enough storage capacity, making them ideal for all your belongings. High-Quality Fabric Storage Cubes for Enhanced Durability: Crafted from soft cotton rope and supported by a metal wire frame, our cube organizer bins are designed to last. These collapsible storage bins boast a sturdy construction, ensuring they maintain their shape while providing enough storage space for all your items. The cloth storage bins are perfect for use in various cube storage organizer setups, offering enhanced durability and organization. Versatile Cloth Storage Bins for Multiple Uses: Our cube storage bins 11 x 11 are perfect for organizing a wide variety of items, including clothes, toys, books, and more. Use our cubby storage solution as closet bins for shelves or within your cube storage organizer to create a neat and organized space tailored to your needs. Our cube organizer bins are designed to offer versatile and convenient storage solutions, making them perfect for all your cube storage organizer requirements. Collapsible and Convenient Cube Storage Organizer Bins: Designed for easy storage when not in use, our collapsible storage bins can be folded flat, saving valuable space and making them a practical choice for all your storage needs. The cube organizer bins offer a flexible storage solution that can be easily adapted to suit your requirements, providing you with a versatile and space-saving cube storage organizer solution. Multi-functional and Stylish Fabric Storage Cubes: These fabric storage cubes are ideal for use in any room, offering a stylish and functional storage solution. Whether use cubby storage in your kid’s room, closet bins for shelves in your bedroom, or a cube storage organizer in your living room, our cube storage organizer bins will help you keep your space organized and looking great. Enjoy the convenience and style that our cube storage bins 11 x 11 provide, ensuring your space organized.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815F7IzYWUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOFUGA","source_asin":"B0BL6MMPGQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1107087","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL6MMPGQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL6MMPGQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
