window.products.push({"id":1107104,"name":"TOPINCN Mist Maker Mini Creating Atmospheres Black Fog Maker with No Light for Water Fountain Pond Fish Tank","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.73,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TC7JFzHQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description: Our mist makers are perfect for the use and decor in your pond, rockery, fish tank, fountains, etc, and it will create a incredible atmospheres.  Features: Brand new and high quality mist maker for water fountain, pond and other decor.  Adds a stunning mist effect to your pond or water tank.  It can be used as an air humidifier to remove dust, preserve moisture, filter the bad smell and freshes the air.  No heat or chemicals used. Easy to install and use with long service life.  Great decor for fish tank, indoor or outdoor fountains, water feature, water crafts.   Specifications: Condition: 100% Brand New Shell Material: Plastic, Stainless Steel Color: Black Power: 600MA/24V DC Atomizing Amount: 300ml/h Plug: Female Plug Operating Temperature: +5℃~-45℃ Optimal Water Depth: 4~6cm / 1.57~2.36in Mist Maker Size(Diam. *H): Approx. 3.5 * 2.5cm / 1.38 * 0.98in Atomizing Slice Diameter: Approx. 1.6cm / 0.63in Line Length: Approx. 1.4m / 55.1in Weight: Approx. 185g  Package Included: 1 * Mist Maker  Note: 1. Don't touch the atomizing slice while the mist maker is working.  2. Please switch off the power before movement or maintenance.  3. Please allow 0~1 inch error due to manual measurement. Thanks for your understanding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TC7JFzHQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOPINCN","source_asin":"B09879BY9S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1107104","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09879BY9S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09879BY9S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1107105,"name":"LifeAir Air Fillter 10\"x20\"x1\" Antiviral Anti-allergen Washable HEPA 100% MADE IN USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cH-eHrcHL._AC_.jpg","description":"Clean the air you breathe with less stress, less hassle, and more comfort. The LifeAir Filter works via electrostatic principles. As air passes through the filter, positively charged elements adhere to the custom made LifeAir fabric. Over 99% of all dust, viruses, allergens, fungus, single-celled organisms, bacteria, metals, and gaseous elements are positively charged. LifeAir Filters take advantage of this charge principle rather than simply trying to block contaminants via netting with smaller pores, meaning greater air flow in your house and longer lasting a/c units. Our filter media is made with knitted loops as opposed to corrugated media on other filters, which gives our filters a 3x greater surface area to increase the effectiveness of electrostatic principles. DIRECTIONS: LifeAir Filters are reusable. Simply rinse off with ONLY water once per month, then let your filter dry before re-installing. It’s that simple! Go Green. All materials used in LifeAir Filters are recyclable and save from disposing of hundreds or even thousands of cheap filters in a single lifetime – saving our environment. RISK FREE: If you don't love your Life Air Filters, return them for a full refund. For any questions/concerns, feel free to contact us via our Life Air Filters website.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cH-eHrcHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LifeAir Filters","source_asin":"B01L7P5LDW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1107105","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01L7P5LDW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01L7P5LDW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
