window.products.push({"id":1107167,"name":"GSEICE 2500W Commercial Ice Cream Maker Machine, 6.8-8.4 Gal/H Soft Serve Machine with Precooling & Refrigeration at Night, FDA Approve LED Panel, 2+1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":2898.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F-Cw5t7kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"26-32 L/H Yield & 3 Flavors: Our commercial ice cream machine produces soft and fluffy ice cream efficiently. Its hourly yield reaches 26-32 L (6.8-8.4 Gal). Double 6L (1.6 Gal) mixing hoppers and 1.8 L (0.5 Gal) freezing cylinders made of SUS304 can provide up to 300 servings hourly, and meet your commercial requirement. Adjustable pre-cooling temperature adapted to personal requirements. Besides, 2 unique and 1 combined flavor increase your dessert menu and offer customers different tastes. 42° Panel ＆ Pre-cooling: Our soft serve ice cream maker features a smart unique 42-degree digital panel design that helps you monitor the machine's operation without stooping down. The quantity is displayed on the LED screen for direct observation. You can set the ice creams harder or softer according to your taste, put the raw materials in the hopper overnight, enjoy tastier ice creams due to the pre-cooling and deep puffing function and self-cleaning can be activated just with one click. The 2500W power provides continuous and lasting power for our soft ice cream machine. With the 1200W compressor, high efficiency and low noise are ensured during operation. Own patent of puffing technical increases the puffing efficiency, working with a puffing tube makes your ice cream more attractive and saves raw materials. Besides, the shortage alarm will remind you to add more ingredients to the mixing hopper. One stretch front design offers you more operating space and even makes sundaes. Considerate Product Details: Our soft serve machine combines user-friendly designs to improve your user experience. The dust-proof lid effectively keeps your mixtures clean and sanitary. 3 handles are ergonomically designed and make pressing ice cream out effortless. The extensive cooling vents on both sides facilitate rapid heat dissipation and avoid over-heating damage. The drip tray is detachable for regular cleaning, and 4 caster wheels (2 with brake) make it easy to move on the floor. Well-Designed for Wide Uses: Designed in a size of 21.3\"x26.8\"x37.4\" (54x68x95 cm), our commercial ice cream maker can perfectly fit into commercial places. The stainless steel construction ensures enhanced durability and an eye-pleasing appearance. This unit is widely applicable for snack bars, cafés, bakeries, fast food chains, restaurants, buffets, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F-Cw5t7kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GSEICE","source_asin":"B0B9YB8L6R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1107167","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9YB8L6R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9YB8L6R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
