window.products.push({"id":1107173,"name":"Master Maison Authentic 8\" Damascus Steel Chef Knife With Full-Tang Wood Handle, Sheath, Sharpening Stone, Storage Box, & Drying Cloth | AUS-10 Japane","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":87.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Qx6CU0quL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM DAMASCUS CHEFS KNIFE SET - Each blade is meticulously crafted by condensing 67 layers of stainless steel to achieve true Damascus authenticity and quality, and then hand-finished for ultimate sharpness, hardness (62 HRC), performance, and durability. This knife set includes a Supreme Series 8 inch Damascus stainless steel knife with a full-tang Japanese mosaic handle, knife sheath, sharpening stone, embroidered drying cloth, and wooden storage box. PROFESSIONAL QUALITY AT AN AFFORDABLE PRICE - Master Maison was founded by 2 lifelong cooks who struggled to find professional-quality knives at everyday prices. Our Californian founders partnered with dozens of professional chefs to design stain-resistant and rust-resistant knife sets at an affordable price point. SUPERIOR EDGE RETENTION: This Damascus knife is forged from the highest quality, rare Japanese stainless steel. It offers remarkable sharpness, superior edge retention (stays sharp for longer) and rust and corrosion resistance that will last you a lifetime. BEAUTIFUL DESIGN WITH EASY STORAGE - An intricate, mosaic design is rooted in rich Japanese history and sets this Damascus chef knife apart. The included storage box reduces clutter from the counter and protects your one-of-a-kind Master Maison knife for years to come. EASY CARE AND UNLIMITED 1-YEAR WARRANTY: Our knives carry an unlimited 1-year warranty. We recommend hand washing and promptly drying your knives after usage to protect their sharpness and glossiness. If you ever have an issue, reach out to our customer service team.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Qx6CU0quL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Master Maison","source_asin":"B09LBX6ZSB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1107173","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LBX6ZSB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LBX6ZSB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
