window.products.push({"id":1107277,"name":"French Bull 13-1/2-Inch by 8-Inch Rectangular Melamine Platter, Mosaic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TSVY75zQL._AC_.jpg","description":"French Bull offers house ware products for design conscious consumers at accessible prices. Their distinctive look; their mastery of pattern and color comes to life in a wide range of products for your modern lifestyle. French Bull’s bold, pop culture design is the signature style of designer Jackie Shapiro. After graduating from Parson’s School of Design, Jackie began working in Italy for Milan's innovative fashion house, Fiorucci. It was there where she began breathing life into familiar images with her graphic style grounded in color and steeped in imagination. Jackie’s bold and graphic colors are culled from a uniquely selected palette that can be mixed, matched and tied together with an array of striking solids and patterns. French Bull’s house wares continue to be ahead of the curve in reinterpreting everyday staples with a fresh look for a contemporary lifestyle. The Mosaic Platter, like many of their other products, is made of 100 -percent melamine. Melamine is resistant to high heat, it’s shatterproof, and an ideal ground for pattern. Plus, melamine does not easily absorb fluids from food, which helps you avoid contaminating your food with harmful bacteria – a leading cause of illness and food poisoning. The durability and functionality of the material is perfect for indoor or outdoor entertaining, everyday use and is completely safe for children. The Mosaic pattern is unique and bold – the perfect design to spice up your existing collection or to serve as a foundation for a new collection. The Rectangular Mosaic Platter measures 13.5 X 8”. It features a glazed surface that resists scratches. Not for microwave use. Top rack dishwasher safe. French Bull – reinterpreting everyday staples with a fresh, modern spin!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TSVY75zQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"French Bull","source_asin":"B001VEJD9S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1107277","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001VEJD9S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001VEJD9S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1107278,"name":"M&T Displays Snap Poster Frame 24x36 Inch Black 1\" Aluminum Profile Front Loading Wall Mounting Photo Picture Document Certificate Sign Holder Mitered","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HryOPlsxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ALUMINUM SNAP FRAME: M&T Displays is a company with over 25 years of experience in display framing production. This frame is made of aluminum and has polystyrene backing. The product will be shipped as assembled and it is ready to use. Wall mounting hardware kit is included in the package. FRONT LOADING: The use of this aluminum frame is fairly easy. To load or change a graphic, simply snap open the four spring-loaded frame edges, remove the anti-glare transparent cover and place graphic, picture, photo, poster and or artwork as required, then snap close the frame edges. The anti-glare cover allows a clear view of the print, poster and protects the artwork from dust and direct light. DURABLE: It is made of the finest materials while providing the highest level of quality. The aluminum profile makes the product durable yet light to carry easily. Anodized finish will protect the frame from dust and light scratches. VERSATILE: Suitable for indoor use. It can be used portrait or landscape position. An excellent way to get attention when you want to display pictures, photos, posters, documents or certificates, marketing advertisements, promotions, important messages. It can be used in a multipurpose setting, whether this may be at your place of business, office, markets, cafes, restaurants, shopping centers, cinemas, cafes, theaters, hospitals or more. CONSISTENT CUSTOMER SERVICE: 5-year warranty offered by M&T Displays. Sturdy and safe packaging help ensure safe delivery. Feel free to ask any questions about product and installation. We are always here to help.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HryOPlsxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"M&T Displays","source_asin":"B07K7XCQSB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1107278","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07K7XCQSB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07K7XCQSB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1107279,"name":"Xpeciall Smooth Soft Edge Automatic Electric Can Opener","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mWXq5L87L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Operation 1. The cutter should be in the open position with a space between the gear and the cutter (which should be retracted within the plastic housing). If the blade and cutter are engaged, carefully press and hold the reset button until the motor stops.  2. Place your can on a flat counter or tabletop then place the opener on top of the can with the can rim between the gear and cutter.  3. Press the switch button for a few seconds, let it clamp the can, and then it works automatically. After the cutting is completed, remove the can opener. If can still grip cans, and then press the switch button to release.  4. when finished, lift the opener off the can. Carefully remove the lid from the magnet and discard.  5.If the can is not completely opened push the start button again. Size: 6.7 x 3 x 2.3 in Package Included: 1 Electric Can Opener (without battery)1 Bottle Wrench1 operating instruction1 Multi-opener accessories","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mWXq5L87L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Xpeciall","source_asin":"B079NR6YKM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1107279","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079NR6YKM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079NR6YKM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
