window.products.push({"id":1107310,"name":"Purafide XP280 Veteran Owned 2-Yr H13 HEPA 3-stage filtration air purifier with Elegant Old Fashion Control Buttons for 1700 Sq Ft Coverage. Home, Bed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qBxq4PbtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easy Setup, Quite Operation, 3-Stage Filtration Including 2-Year H13 HEPA For Lowest Cost of Filter Replacement & Hassle-Free Maintenance, Lifetime Warranty, Impeccable Customer Care. EXTENDED LIFE 2-YEAR H13 MEDICAL GRADE FILTER: It also comes with a protective coating to neutralize other disease causing pollutants. The pre-filter is detachable & washable and is for large particles like dust, hair and lent. The 2 year rating is based on average household usage, if your environment is heavier in dust and particles the life of your HEPA could be reduced to 18 months or even 1 year. Clean the pre-filter every 1-3 months to help extend the life of the HEPA filter. POWERFUL UNIT: It has a CADR of 280 & covers up to 1700 sq ft/hour, 850 sq ft/30 minutes, 425 sq ft/15 min on High speed. Built-In Particle sensor adjusts fan speed as needed. A light inside the chamber signifies the air quality; blue, orange or red. It is stylish with simple to operate ‘old-fashioned’, round, push buttons. 4 Fan speeds, control to turn on/off light, child lock, filter replacement indicator. Includes extra accessories like 3 pin adaptor & a heavy duty Re-usable Velcro Cord Wrap. LOWER COST OF OWNERSHIP: XP280 Purifier reduces your ownership cost versus other air purifiers that have a 3, 4, 6 month filter replacement cycle. This also reduces the hassle of remembering and replacing the filter every 3 or 4 months, as well as all that replacement filter cost. We also offer Lifetime Warranty on our units. However, it is valid only if original Purified Replacement filter (ASIN B095RJ9Z1M) are being used on the purifier. US VETERAN OWNED & OPERATED: We are a proud American family-owned Brand, founded, owned & operated by a US Veteran company. A portion of every unit sold goes to support Veteran Services.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qBxq4PbtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Purafide","source_asin":"B0BPXVNN5J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1107310","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPXVNN5J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPXVNN5J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
