window.products.push({"id":1107375,"name":"Champagne Bottle Balloon Kit, 40\" Champagne Wine Bottle Rose Gold Balloon and 70PCS Balloons Garland Arch Kit Rose Gold Confetti Balloons for Wedding ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61P5DKWRlFL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Package Including - 1Pcs Champagne Bottle Balloons, 1 balloon tying tools, 2 roll glue point, 16 feet balloon tape strip (5m), 1 pcs 40\"champagne bottle, 10 pcs Rose Gold Heart Confetti Balloons, 30 pcs 12\" clear balloons, 30 pcs 12\" Rose Gold Latex Balloons. Material - Balloons are made of natural latex materials, sturdy and durable. Bottle balloons made of high quality Foil and rubber. Easy to use. Champagne bottle balloon is Self-Sealing Balloon. Easy To Use - Just inflate the latex balloons to the different sizes, Then using balloon glue dot stick the balloon on the wall. Suitable for both indoor and outdoor decorations, they are suitable for you to use for several times if you store properly. Occasions-Ideal for decor Bachelorette, Weddings, Birthday Parties, Perfect decoration - backdrop and photo prop for birthdays, engagement parties, bachelorette parties, bridal showers, weddings parties, graduations, new years, and many more celebrations. Easy to Assemble - Simply inflate your balloons and secure to the provided balloon strip tape, you can hang the balloons on the wall near the desk, over a door frame, entryway, along the staircase or use it for a custom photo booth party backdrop, these balloons are gorgeous when used to make balloons bouquets for home and table decorations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61P5DKWRlFL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FHzytg","source_asin":"B083K33N3M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1107375","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083K33N3M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083K33N3M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1107376,"name":"OLIVE & OAK HOMEWARE Salt and Pepper Bowls | Salt Cellar Salt Box | Bamboo Salt Container with Gold Lids and Spoons","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91EeyasjUbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2 FOR THE PRICE OF 1 – Our Salt and Pepper Bowls are priced similarly to individual salt cellars. Why pay double to purchase two separate containers to house your salt and pepper when you can get double the value? NEVER MISPLACE THE SALT - Where’s the salt?! With separate salt and pepper bowls, you’re bound to find yourself looking for one or the other at some point. Your husband takes the salt to his desk for his lunch, you leave the salt in the pantry - whatever it is, it’ll frustrate you. With our unique, combined design of 2 salt bowls carved from 1 block of bamboo you can avoid those testy moments altogether. BEAUTIFULLY CRAFTED WOOD – Our salt box is uniquely and thoughtfully designed. This custom designed piece offers two cellars in one to house both salt and pepper or any of your other favorite spices. The two-in-one salt cellar with lid is crafted from high-quality bamboo which means it'll last for years and years to come! COUNTERTOP CONVENIENCE – Have salt and pepper at the ready on your table or countertop. Housed in a visually appealing container, this sophisticated salt bowl elevates your serving experience so you can feel like you're at an upscale restaurant at every meal. HIGH END MID CENTURY MODERN DESIGN – With durable, copper metal hardware finished in a mid-century modern style, our rose gold lids makes for an excellent complement to the rich bamboo finish. Thanks to its timeless makeup, our salt cellar will effortlessly fit into any homestyle whether it be Modern, Rustic, Boho, Traditional, Farmhouse or others. GIVING BACK - At Olive & Oak, we believe in being there and taking care of each other. That’s why we donate 10% of our profits to registered charities that promote love, acceptance and kindness as well as organizations that undertake humanitarian aid to help those in need.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91EeyasjUbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OLIVE & OAK HOMEWARE","source_asin":"B0BDD6J6HG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1107376","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDD6J6HG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDD6J6HG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
