window.products.push({"id":1107499,"name":"South Shore Quilliams Platform/Storage Bed, Twin, Ebony Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uwkh4HRzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Quilliams Twin Storage Bed, in its rich Ebony Black finish will certainly add character to the bedroom as it features 3 convenient drawers for additional storage. The drawers open easily, without handles, thanks to the indentation at the bottom and are reversible. Pair it with the rest of the Quilliams collection to create a traditional decor that will last for years to come. Weight capacity 250 lbs, no box spring required. The drawer dimensions are: 22-1/2-inch wide by 14-1/4-inch front to back by 4-1/4-inch high. It will fit with standard twin size mattress. It measures 76-1/4-inch long by 40-1/4-inch wide by 14-1/2-inch high. It is delivered in a box measuring 85-Inch by 20-3/4-inch by 4-1/2-inch and weighing 117 pound. Mattress and accessories not included. Manufactured from certified environmentally preferred laminated particle panels. Complete assembly required by 2 adults. Tools are not included. 5 years limited warranty. Made in Canada.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uwkh4HRzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"South Shore","source_asin":"B00AYUS3YQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1107499","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AYUS3YQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AYUS3YQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1107500,"name":"The Pioneer Woman Blooming Bouquet Non-Adhesive Shelf Liner, 12\" x10'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pX6en4iAS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You do a lot to organize, decorate, and keep your home in its best shape, which is why The Pioneer Woman Blooming Bouquet Non-Adhesive Shelf Liner does all three in a simple and affordable way. With a variety of colors and trendy patterns for you to choose from, you can bring new life to old cabinets, drawers, and shelves. Just cut, apply to your surface, and style away. Its unique design prevents the liner from bunching and doesn't leave a sticky residue, so you can remove, reposition, and redecorate with ease as many times as you'd like. Mix and match this shelf liner with other pieces in The Pioneer Woman collection to create a gorgeous ranch-style home. Keep your home organized and looking great with The Pioneer Woman Blooming Bouquet Non-Adhesive Shelf Liner. Meet Ree: Ree Drummond is a NY Times Best Selling Author, TV personality, social media phenom, and the woman behind the popular Pioneer Woman lifestyle blog that started it all. She's also a lover of butter, basset hounds, Ethel Merman, her hunky, cowboy husband Ladd, and their four kids. Her casual country style and delicious recipes have made her a go-to for all things cooking and entertaining. The Pioneer Woman Blooming Bouquet Non-Adhesive Shelf Liner, 12\" x 10': -Non-adhesive grip bottom keeps liner in place -Smooth surface makes it easy to slide objects across -Easy to install -Ideal for lining cabinets in your kitchen, bathroom, and laundry room -Machine washable in cold water. Lay flat to dry","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pX6en4iAS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TPW","source_asin":"B091NFGCZW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1107500","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091NFGCZW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091NFGCZW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1107501,"name":"Trudeau 11-Inch Silicone Splatter Screen, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MEejQ6zLL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Trudeau’s innovative multi-purpose 11” silicone splatter screen features an easy to clean surface. Side handles make for super easy storage (no long handle to contend with) and fits easily in the dishwasher. Also, side handles use less room on the stove top when cooking with multiple pans. Spatter screen is heat resistant up to 500 degrees F. Cleverly designed to be used as a trivet, pot strainer or splatter screen. Amazon.com Trudeau delivers a smart, versatile kitchen tool with this splatter screen that also acts as a trivet and pot-strainer. Crafted from durable, heat-resistant silicone, the screen protects clothing and cooking surfaces from splattering grease. In contrast to old-style metal screens, it has eared handles that make it easier to store and clean, and it pops right into the dishwasher, so grease does not accumulate over time. Its space-efficient design is also nice on the table when it is acting as a trivet. Heat-resistant to 500 degrees F, the piece measures 11 inches in diameter and comes in a fun shade of red. Trudeau includes a five-year warranty. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MEejQ6zLL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trudeau","source_asin":"B0015VJ4QE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1107501","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0015VJ4QE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0015VJ4QE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
