window.products.push({"id":1107609,"name":"Dash Pass 60 Pcs Natural Dried Pampas Grass - 30 White and 30 Beige Stalks for Home Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71o5W30HGlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Thinking of breathing new life into your indoor space with nature's charm? Decorating your home with flowers is an excellent way of sprucing up your living space. DASH PASS is proud to bring the pampas grass white for your home decor and other events. Pampas stems can add ornamental value to the beauty of your house. It just feels good to see natural flora adding life, color, and texture to your home interior. Long Last: Fresh flowers are an excellent choice, but they do wilt all too quickly. What you need is dried flowers or foliage that stay beautiful for a long time even without requiring tedious, time-consuming maintenance. Easy to Adjust: Display these pampas grass fluffy in an ornate vase or use them to decorate wedding arches. The stems measure 22 inches long and are individually wrapped to preserve their form. You may also cut the stalks to fit smaller jars and decorative containers and vessels. Mixed Color Package: Pampas grass decor features a mixed package containing 60 Pcs long stems - 30 of them are white, and 30 are in natural beige color. Which can be a symbol color of the four seasons. Need more time to decide? Here are more reasons to love our pampas grass plumes: Handpicked from natural sources No artificial material was used Decorate your office, home, or use for events Last year, no need to be watered or trimmed Perfect gift idea for any special occasion Small pampas grass has a realistic appearance. No smell, no mess, no shedding. No need for water and soil, nutrients, evergreen all seasons. Note: During transit, the stalks may lose a bit of their fluffiness. To fluff them up, we suggest placing the stalks under warm sunshine or next to a window for a few hours. You may also warm them up using a hairdryer on a low setting for a few minutes","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71o5W30HGlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09CFV95QJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1107609","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CFV95QJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CFV95QJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
