window.products.push({"id":1107964,"name":"15 Pcs Dried Eucalyptus for Shower Stems and Lavender Bundle, Rose Bundle ,with Lavender Sachet,17\" Natural Real Eucalyptus Hanging Lavender Shower Pl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81g1opAmIXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Package Contents: 15 Pcs Dried Eucalyptus 1.8 oz (approx. 80-100) Dried Lavender Roses Bundle  Sachet filled with lavender seeds Hemp Rope  Color: green and purple, red  Length: 16-18 inches  Package Dimensions: 17 x 2.76 x 2.72 inches  Weight: 9.0 oz   How to use:  There is a hemp rope in the package, wash the fallen lavender seeds, use the rope to tie up the roots of roses, lavender and eucalyptus, and hang them behind the shower.   Kind tips:  1. A soothing blend of Eucalyptus and Lavender envelops you in an environment of pure well-being and relaxation. The freshness of Eucalyptus, combined with the soothing aroma of Lavender, provides a sweet balance between the two. Be Healed by Eucalyptus and Lavender  2. Dried lavender seeds will be partially shed, which is inevitable and can be collected in bags, most of its fragrance comes from the seeds. But the smell fades away over time. Nothing lasts forever, including a captivating scent (tinted glycerin) that replaces the moisture in the plant.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81g1opAmIXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"POETIC WREATH","source_asin":"B0BJSZ6J1V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1107964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJSZ6J1V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJSZ6J1V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
