window.products.push({"id":1107984,"name":"OTK L Shaped Desk with Round Corner, 51\" L Shaped Gaming Desk, Corner Computer Desk Table with Large Monitor Stand for Home Office, Sturdy Writing Wor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DIiRSOujL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"L SHAPED DESK and MUCH MORE THAN THAT: Not just an l shaped computer desk, a gaming desk, you also get a removable shelf with this desk. This shelf could be installed on either left or right side as you see fit. It helps you ergonomically positioning your monitor while providing you with extra storage space. Cheers for a larger desk space. ELEGANT MODERN STYLE CONSTRUCTED WITH STURDINESS: The L-shaped computer desk is constructed by a high-quality E1 MDF board and metal frame. Guaranteed great load-bearing, durability, and sturdiness. 1.2\" by 0.6\" bar width strongly enough to support heavy duty parcels. The desktop of this l shaped desk is made of a textured surface, it is waterproof, anti-scratch, and very easy to clean. LARGE SIZE & AMPLE SPACE: (51\"+51\")L*18.1\"W double desktop, giving you wide room for computing tasks on one side and other tasks, such as reading, writing etc, on the other. Desk Height 29.5\", Plenty room for leg resting and storage. Adjustable Leg Pads are included to keep the desk stable even on an uneven floor. SUPER EASY TO INSTALL and EASY CLEANING: Only 7 steps are required for a complete l shaped computer desk installation. Detailed instructions and tools for installing are all included. Please strictly follow the installation guide to avoid reinstallation. SMILEY CUSTOMER SERVICE: Welcome to Contact Us! Your satisfaction is our first priority – We've got you anytime you have any issue regarding our product quality or any problem during your purchase. Easy and fast response and replacement are guaranteed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DIiRSOujL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OTK","source_asin":"B08DQJKQV6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1107984","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DQJKQV6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DQJKQV6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1107985,"name":"Mora Ceramic Flat Bowls Set of 4-25 oz- For Soup, Salad, Rice, Cereal, Breakfast, Dinner, Serving, Oatmeal, etc - Microwave, Dishwasher and Oven Safe ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fby6B9dDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"IT’S TIME TO HIT PAUSE AND EAT: This is more than a bowl. Mora is Latin for \"Pause\", acting as a reminder to slow down in your amazing life. You are always being told to do more, to go faster, to be better, but it's time for you to slow down every once in a while and hit pause. Your Mora bowls can help you do that. Whether you are eating noodles, salad, or anything else, every time you use a Mora bowl it is a reminder to hit pause, give yourself some me time, and practice mindful eating. LEAD FREE ALL NATURAL GLAZE: We know that lead is a poison, but what some of us don't know is that it is in a lot of ceramic glazes, since there is no US regulation for lead in adult products. Unlike other ceramic companies, our glazes are lead free, meaning you will never have to worry about lead leaching into your system and making you sick. Since our glaze is all-natural, it tends to change color depending on the lighting. The color may be a tad different from what you see on your screen. CRYSTALLIZED SCRATCH RESISTANT FORMULA: Our glaze is not only lead free, but also extra strong to prevent scratches from your knives and forks. Only we produce a crystallized glossy glaze that is strong enough to resist scratches under 1000 grams of pressure. CERAMIC WITH 20% STRONGER PALADIN CLAY: Our clay was refined and fired with you in mind. Only we have Paladin Clay which is 20% stronger than the competitors, giving you a stronger and more durable ceramic bowl. The shape was designed to stack and nestle nicely in your cupboard or shelves, help your food look even more delicious, and make you happy every day. Our bowls are microwavable and also freezer, oven, and dishwasher safe. MORA’S PROMISE: We provide a free refund or replacement for any defective products, anytime. Just let us know what happened. We offer daily customer service because you are important to us. Our objective is to help you hit pause, so we won’t settle for anything you don’t love. We’re not happy unless you are.❤","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fby6B9dDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MORA CERAMICS HIT PAUSE","source_asin":"B09V4KY93N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1107985","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V4KY93N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V4KY93N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
